<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese July industrial employment up 0.3 m/m.</title>
<headline>Portuguese July industrial employment up 0.3 m/m.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The index of Portuguese industrial employment rose 0.3 percent in July, compared with June, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>The index of industrial sales rose 14.7 percent in July, compared with June, it added.</p>
<p>				    July 1996  June 1996   July 1995</p>
<p> INDEX INDUSTRIAL EMPLOYMENT  81.8	 81.6	   84.6</p>
<p> Mth/mth			    +0.3	 +0.3</p>
<p> Yr/yr				-3.3	 -4.0</p>
<p> INDEX INDUSTRIAL SALES	164.1	143.1	  146.6</p>
<p> Mth/mth			   +14.7	 -8.5</p>
<p> Yr/yr			     +11.9	 -1.7</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
